{"4":["              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">Information about a person&#8217;s health may receive additional protection under UK data-protection law.</p>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">This can include some information relating to:</p>","              <ul style=\"margin: 12px 0 0; padding-left: 22px;\">\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">allergies;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">intolerances;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">medical dietary requirements; or</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">other health-related information.</li>\n              </ul>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">We only use this type of information where:</p>","              <ul style=\"margin: 12px 0 0; padding-left: 22px;\">\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">there is a genuine reason for us to need it;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">we have an appropriate legal basis;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">any additional legal condition required for sensitive information applies; and</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">access is limited to people who reasonably need it.</li>\n              </ul>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">Where we rely on your <strong style=\"font-weight: 600; color: var(--green-forest);\">explicit consent</strong>, we will ask for that consent clearly and separately.</p>","              <h4 style=\"margin: 24px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--green-forest);\">General enquiries</h4>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">Our ordinary Contact form is not intended for detailed medical histories.</p>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">If you voluntarily provide health information that is relevant to your enquiry, we will only use it where lawful and reasonably necessary to deal with that enquiry.</p>","              <h4 style=\"margin: 24px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--green-forest);\">Private Table</h4>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">At launch, the Private Table waitlist will <strong style=\"font-weight: 600; color: var(--green-forest);\">not ask you for detailed medical or health information</strong>.</p>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">If Private Table later requires health-related information as part of a consultation, we will provide additional privacy information at the point that information is collected.</p>"],"5":["              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">We may share personal information with organisations that help us provide Abby&#8217;s Table services.</p>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">These may include:</p>","              <div class=\"at-p-prov\" style=\"margin: 16px 0 0;\">\n                <div class=\"at-p-prov-row\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--brown);\">Payments</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--taupe);\">Payment provider &#8212; to be confirmed</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"at-p-prov-row\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--brown);\">Delivery</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--taupe);\">Delivery provider &#8212; to be confirmed</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"at-p-prov-row\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--brown);\">Website and hosting</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--taupe);\">Website / hosting provider &#8212; to be confirmed</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"at-p-prov-row\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--brown);\">Email and customer communications</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--taupe);\">Email / CRM provider &#8212; to be confirmed</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"at-p-prov-row\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--brown);\">Analytics</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--taupe);\">Analytics provider, where permitted &#8212; to be confirmed</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"at-p-prov-row\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--brown);\">Advertising</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--taupe);\">Advertising provider, where permitted &#8212; to be confirmed</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"at-p-prov-row\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--brown);\">Fraud and security</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--taupe);\">Fraud / security provider &#8212; to be confirmed</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">We may also share information where appropriate with:</p>","              <ul style=\"margin: 12px 0 0; padding-left: 22px;\">\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">accountants;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">solicitors;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">insurers;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">auditors;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">food-safety authorities;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">HMRC;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">courts;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">law-enforcement agencies; and</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">regulators or other public authorities where required.</li>\n              </ul>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">We only share information that is reasonably necessary for the relevant purpose.</p>","              <h4 style=\"margin: 24px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--green-forest);\">Payments</h4>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">Payments are processed by our payment provider.</p>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">Where payment details are entered directly into the payment provider&#8217;s system, Abby&#8217;s Table does not receive or store your complete payment-card number.</p>","              <h4 style=\"margin: 24px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--green-forest);\">Customer-service images</h4>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">If you upload an image to help us investigate an enquiry or complaint, we may use it to assess matters such as food condition, packaging, delivery or product quality.</p>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">Uploading an image for customer service does <strong style=\"font-weight: 600; color: var(--green-forest);\">not</strong> give Abby&#8217;s Table a general right to use that image for advertising or social media.</p>","              <h4 style=\"margin: 24px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--green-forest);\">We do not sell your information</h4>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 600; color: var(--green-forest);\">Abby&#8217;s Table does not sell your personal information to advertisers or data brokers.</strong></p>"],"6":["              <h4 style=\"margin: 24px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--green-forest);\">Marketing</h4>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">If you choose to receive Abby&#8217;s Table marketing, we may send you information about:</p>","              <ul style=\"margin: 12px 0 0; padding-left: 22px;\">\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">new dishes;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">menu launches;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">offers;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">events;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">gifting;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">Abby&#8217;s Table news; and</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">other relevant products or services.</li>\n              </ul>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">At launch, our preference is to use a clear, unticked opt-in.</p>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">You can unsubscribe at any time using the link in a marketing email or by contacting us.</p>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">Marketing consent is separate from placing an order or accepting our Terms.</p>","              <h4 style=\"margin: 24px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--green-forest);\">Private Table waitlist</h4>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">If you join the Private Table waitlist, we use your information to:</p>","              <ul style=\"margin: 12px 0 0; padding-left: 22px;\">\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">manage the waitlist; and</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">let you know when Private Table consultations or availability open.</li>\n              </ul>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">Joining the waitlist does <strong style=\"font-weight: 600; color: var(--green-forest);\">not</strong> automatically subscribe you to general Abby&#8217;s Table marketing.</p>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">You can leave the waitlist at any time by using the unsubscribe link in any waitlist email, or by contacting us.</p>","              <h4 style=\"margin: 24px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--green-forest);\">Cookies and similar technologies</h4>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">We use cookies and similar technologies to:</p>","              <ul style=\"margin: 12px 0 0; padding-left: 22px;\">\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">operate the website;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">keep it secure;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">maintain your basket and checkout;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">remember certain preferences;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">understand how the website is used; and</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">measure or personalise advertising where applicable.</li>\n              </ul>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">Where consent is required, we ask for it through our cookie controls before using the relevant technology.</p>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">For more information, see our Cookie Policy. You can also change your choices at any time through Cookie preferences, in the footer of every page.</p>"]}